I left out the `http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause still grants only `aap:caps/kb-read@0.1.0`, and a component that imports an ungranted interface will be rejected again. The platform team's approval doesn't change that. The grant has to be extended in the node's `with` clause before this import can link. Sending the user's question text to an external host is also a data-disclosure decision that should be made explicitly, not folded into this change. If the grant is extended, I can add the fetch back.

